	(text "HASSAS RAYLAR — her biri AYRI LDO, AYRI ADA. Anahtarlamalidan BESLENMEZ (§1)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 185 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.6 1.6)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "186acba8-954e-4ae6-8844-dc7d903d88b0")
	)
	(text "VCXO — TEK\nbesleme, FERRIT"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 257 226 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2dbd7d18-c43a-46ce-b513-c14182a91a54")
	)
	(text "AYRISTIRMA (NETLIST.md §1)\nher ECP5 VCC/VCCIO topu 100nF, viasi dogrudan duzleme · ECP5 toplu 4x10uF + 2x47uF\nADC AVDD x8 pin basina 100nF + toplu 10uF · ADC DRVDD x4 100nF\nVCXO 100nF + 10uF + FERRIT BONCUK · PHY 10uF X5R  (Y5V KULLANMA, datasheet s.46-53)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 250 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3f66f2a6-4e1c-4aeb-8ad5-7f94ad5cf629")
	)
	(text "+1V8\nFPGA VCCIO\nbanka 6/3"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 219 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4d6e359c-a64c-4e8b-8bc8-d63f4d0f2ba7")
	)
	(text "ADC DRVDD"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 202 226 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "5ca70be9-6683-4f11-a85a-769d040a4ef4")
	)
	(text "U9 (+1V8_CLK) ADCLK846'nin VS rayi. Veri sayfasi basligi:\n'1.8 V, 6 LVDS/12 CMOS Output Clock Fanout Buffer'. Saat bolumu\nbastan 3.3 V varsayilmisti — tampon o rayda calismaz."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 320 252 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.25 1.25)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "74c8df5a-4bc9-4b7f-9f01-1895f1b21993")
	)
	(text "FPGA VCCAUX\nZORUNLU"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 92 226 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "76e8c5bc-e367-4b3d-a849-d70f41bf82bf")
	)
	(text "Q1 kaynagi girise, drain VIN_PROT'a. Govde diyodu ters baglamada iletmiyor.\nR1 gate'i asagi ceker (P-kanal icin iletim), D2 Vgs'i 12V'ta sinirlar.\nTVS ve sigorta drain tarafinda — koruma yukun oncesinde."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40 74 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.25 1.25)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8020f735-828b-4eac-8438-29a3641428c1")
	)
	(text "1.1V icin oran 0.375.  EN zinciri: U1 PG -> U2 EN,\nguc siralamasi VCC(1.1) once, sonra VCCAUX, sonra VCCIO."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 237 159 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "89e0d78c-763e-44bf-a844-6eb621d34b43")
	)
	(text "U6 (+3V3_CLK) VCXO'nun TEK beslemesi. Ferrit boncuk, ayri toprak adasi.\nBesleme gurultusu DOGRUDAN faz gurultusune donusuyor — manset spec burada."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 105 232 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "91a9e61c-47a4-4a08-806c-00b7b751371e")
	)
	(text "GUC BUTCESI ~2.8 W -> 12V'ta ~230 mA. 10 Ah aku ile ~40 saat.\nSaha modunda ikinci PHY yazilimdan kapatilabilir, 0.25 W kazanc."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 268 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "93f91c1c-2896-4e64-995b-d2e526469a61")
	)
	(text "U8 (+2V5) ECP5 VCCAUX. Ilk guc agacinda ATLANMISTI — FPGA'yi hic\ncalistirmayan turden bir eksik. ADP150AUJZ-2.5, LCSC C144257."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 105 244 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.25 1.25)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "96d59189-88de-4edb-b538-17917d3020ed")
	)
